{"id":"C3c29d2e588f13a6020ef","zh":"动力相互作用","en":"dynamic interaction","domain":"列车轨道基础结构动力学","definition_zh":"系统不同组成部分在动态作用下彼此影响的过程。","definition_en":null,"usage_note":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[{"id":"C3c29d2e588f13a6020ef","zh":"动力相互作用","en":"dynamic interaction","domain":"列车轨道基础结构动力学","group_id":"Hffc5d300d31eb4787a7c","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"列车轨道基础结构动力学 · 徐磊（2023）"},{"id":"Ce9d6a28ace4e0bce0dd9","zh":"动力相互作用","en":"dynamic interaction","domain":"轨道结构与动力学","group_id":"Hffc5d300d31eb4787a7c","abbreviations":[],"context_label":"轨道结构与动力学 · 徐磊等（2023）"}],"designations":[{"id":"D624003e1a257d4a20cea","language":"zh","role":"headword","text":"动力相互作用"},{"id":"Dad9849e91c1230ed84d5","language":"en","role":"headword","text":"dynamic interaction"}],"sources":{"P140":{"id":"P140","title":"铁路列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part I:动力学模型构造与求解","authors":"徐磊","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220719","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-model-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-i-the-dynamics"}},"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sa1b10c9350dbb2bd79e9","source_id":"P140","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"en","text":"The three sub-systems were coupled into a dynamic unified matrix equation, and a unified analysis model for the railway train-track-substructure dynamic interaction was established subsequently.","citations":[{"source_id":"P140","page":2,"page_end":2}]},{"id":"S6e809763ce22ab1867eb","source_id":"P140","page":1,"page_end":1,"language":"zh","text":"视列车、轨道和基础结构为整体系统,以车辆-轨道耦合动力学理论为方法核心,以弹性总势能不变值原理及形成矩阵的“对号入座”法则为建模思路,将三大子系统耦合为动力学统一矩阵方程,建立铁路列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用统一分析模型。","citations":[{"source_id":"P140","page":1,"page_end":1}]},{"id":"S78127fe7a30e4b7a3023","source_id":"P140","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"本文以车辆−轨道耦合动力学为方法导引 [1],将列车、轨道和基础结构作为动力学统一系统;另外,基于复杂系统宜用能量原理的基本思路,引入弹性总势能不变值原理及形成矩阵的“对号入座”法则 [2],建立了铁路列车−轨道−基础结构动力相互作用统一分析模型(见图1),现就主要内容加以叙述,并阐明其主要建模过程及基本原理。","citations":[{"source_id":"P140","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"related_terms":[{"id":"C30ca8725e97464966f50","target_concept_id":"C30ca8725e97464966f50","target_zh":"车辆-轨道耦合动力学","target_en":"vehicle-track coupling dynamics","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"C15fa8b9ce6cedb04f243","target_concept_id":"C15fa8b9ce6cedb04f243","target_zh":"列车-轨道-基础结构","target_en":"Train-track-substructure","label":"同句术语","reason":null},{"id":"Cfb9028eaecb91cd62d7f","target_concept_id":"Cfb9028eaecb91cd62d7f","target_zh":"基础结构","target_en":"railway infrastructure","label":"同句术语","reason":null}],"suggested_comparisons":[],"relations":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"families":[],"sense_choices":[],"related_sources":[{"id":"P140","title":"铁路列车-轨道-基础结构动力相互作用统一分析Part I:动力学模型构造与求解","authors":"徐磊","year":"2023","doi":"10.19713/j.cnki.43-1423/u.T20220719","journal_citation":"铁道科学与工程学报","label":"徐磊（2023）","overview_slug":"2023-unified-analysis-model-for-railway-train-track-substructure-dynamic-interaction-part-i-the-dynamics"}]}